name: Cultural Property Transfer Act (CPTA)
description: SR 444.1 — Federal Act of 20 June 2003 on the International Transfer of Cultural Property (Cultural Property Transfer Act, CPTA). Unofficial English mirror of the Fedlex consolidation of 1 March 2026. No legal force.
